     ddddbb — configure DDB kernel debugger properties

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     ddddbb ccaappttuurree [--MM --ccoorree] [--NN --ssyysstteemm] pprriinntt
     ddddbb ccaappttuurree [--MM --ccoorree] [--NN --ssyysstteemm] ssttaattuuss
